  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Weakness, numbness of the ring and little fingers, and curling of those fingers in the right hand for four weeks after a fall onto the right elbow, in a left-handed artist who uses the right hand for the palette and brushwork; stroke and a peripheral nerve lesion under evaluation</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
